.IX Title "DGRCLI 1"
.TH DGRCLI 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "BP executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
dgrcli \- DGR\-based BP convergence layer reception task
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBdgrcli\fR \fIlocal_hostname\fR[:\fIlocal_port_nbr\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBdgrcli\fR is a background "daemon" task that handles DGR convergence layer
protocol input.
.PP
The daemon receives DGR messages via a UDP socket bound to
\&\fIlocal_hostname\fR and \fIlocal_port_nbr\fR, extracts bundles from those
messages, and passes them to the bundle protocol agent on the local ION node.
(\fIlocal_port_nbr\fR defaults to 1113 if not specified.)
.PP
\&\fBdgrcli\fR is spawned automatically by \fBbpadmin\fR in response to the 's' (START)
command that starts operation of the Bundle Protocol, and it is terminated by
\&\fBbpadmin\fR in response to an 'x' (STOP) command.  \fBdgrcli\fR can also be
spawned and terminated in response to START and STOP commands that pertain
specifically to the DGR convergence layer protocol.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBdgrcli\fR terminated normally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.  If
this termination was not commanded, investigate and solve the problem identified
in the log file and use \fBbpadmin\fR to restart \fBdgrcli\fR.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBdgrcli\fR terminated abnormally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.
Investigate and solve the problem identified in the log file, then use
\&\fBbpadmin\fR to restart \fBdgrcli\fR.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "dgrcli can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "dgrcli can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized Bundle Protocol operations.
.IP "No such dgr induct." 4
.IX Item "No such dgr induct."
No DGR induct with duct name matching \fIlocal_hostname\fR and \fIlocal_port_nbr\fR
has been added to the BP database.  Use \fBbpadmin\fR to stop the DGR
convergence-layer protocol, add the induct, and then restart the DGR protocol.
.IP "CLI task is already started for this engine." 4
.IX Item "CLI task is already started for this engine."
Redundant initiation of \fBdgrcli\fR.
.IP "Can't get IP address for host" 4
.IX Item "Can't get IP address for host"
Operating system error.  Check errtext, correct problem, and restart DGR.
.IP "dgrcli can't open DGR service access point." 4
.IX Item "dgrcli can't open DGR service access point."
DGR system error.  Check prior messages in \fBion.log\fR log file, correct
problem, and then stop and restart the DGR protocol.
.IP "dgrcli can't create receiver thread" 4
.IX Item "dgrcli can't create receiver thread"
Operating system error.  Check errtext, correct problem, and restart DGR.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBbpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBbprc\fR\|(5)
